Loom: low CSE keeps a duplicate producer whose results only feed low.concat pieces when one of those concats also
consumes the existing producer's result and the concat's result lives in explicit physical registers (AIE2P). Merging
them made the concat take one value as two pieces, which only a register copy can satisfy (48 vmov.256 + 19
vmov.accumulator512 a body in the Scratch NPU attention kernel). GPU sets byte-identical; changes 17 of the NPU split's
27 images (NPU gate: pp2048 split window 00 bit-identical,
hidden / logits / all_logits md5 equal).
